Sun Nov  8 16:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Zyn-Fusion 3.0.6
  * ZynAddSubFX 3.0.6 core built with the zest GUI, plus the
    zyn-fusion-ui-src 3.0.6 interface (bundled mruby, nanovg, pugl)
  * Installs side by side with the classic zynaddsubfx package:
    the core is /usr/bin/zyn-fusion, the UI lives in
    /usr/lib64/zyn-fusion instead of /opt/zyn-fusion, and banks come
    from zynaddsubfx-common
  * Never loads libzest.so or the UI from the current directory
  * LV2 and VST plugins in zyn-fusion-lv2 and zyn-fusion-vst; they
    conflict with zynaddsubfx-lv2/-vst (same URIs)
  * Build fixes from openSUSE:Factory zynaddsubfx:
    zynaddsubfx-buildflags.patch, fix-missing-include.patch,
    0001-Bump-C-version-to-C-20.patch
